# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (built from the repository root).
# Allow-list style: ignore everything, then add back only what the API image needs. Keeps secrets
# (.env), the mobile app, docs and node_modules out of the context and the layer cache stable.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared/
!apps/api/

# Never send these, even inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage
**/*.log
apps/api/test
